{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11206370","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11206370","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1120637001:1":{"text":"이런 식으로 아버지와 다시 만날 줄이야.","source_cn":"没想到，我们会以这种方式和父亲重逢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8ADEAE67C19E6706","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120637002:1":{"text":"아버지는 보물을 찾아 우리를 행복하게 해주겠다며, 거의 집에 돌아오지 않고, 항상 밖에서 떠돌며 남들이 발견 못 한 보물을 찾아 헤맸어요.","source_cn":"以前他总是满世界寻宝，很少回家……他总说要找到无人发现...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B1E529771D96C6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120637003:1":{"text":"형, 그거 알아? 난 사실 아버지를 찾고 싶으면서도, 혹여 행방을 알게 될까 봐 두렵기도 했어.","source_cn":"你知道吗，哥哥……一直以来，我既希望能找到他，又害怕知...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4473D127D20F650A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120637004:1":{"text":"진짜 우리를 버린 건 아닐까, 아니면 타지에서 돌아가신 건 아닐까…","source_cn":"因为我怕他真的抛弃了我们，更怕他……死在外乡。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A73F367C5457A22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120637005:1":{"text":"그래, 네 마음을 이해해. 하지만 우린 아버지를 찾았어.","source_cn":"我明白你的感受……但，我们找到他了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9424811F0E6C4BE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120637006:1":{"text":"자, 이제 아버지께 묘비를 세워 드리자.","source_cn":"来吧，我们找些材料，立好墓碑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEC405E32FAB97F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120637007:1":{"text":"어쩌면 고향보다는 이곳을 더 좋아하실 거야. 이곳에서는 에스페리아에 가장 아름다운 석양을 볼 수 있으니…","source_cn":"相比于家乡，我觉得父亲更喜欢这里——这里有伊索米亚最壮...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FCB64A4F2F8576D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120637008:1":{"text":"석양도 인생이라는 보물찾기에서 찾은 보물이라고 하셨잖아.","source_cn":"他说了，这是他人生旅途上的宝藏。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF07CA5810BE8C15F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120637009:1":{"text":"우리도 도울게요!","source_cn":"我们也来帮忙！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x727F872197E1833B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:宝藏猎人艾文":{"text":"트레져 헌터 에븐","source":"宝藏猎人艾文","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:宝藏猎人欧迪尔":{"text":"오디르","source":"宝藏猎人欧迪尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":10,"localized_text_count":9,"speaker_count":3}}